// The touchscreen gesture HAL is now provided by the shared
// vendor.lineage.touch-service.oplus from hardware/oplus (AIDL). This device
// only supplies the gesture set via touch/include/TouchscreenGestureConfig.h,
// wired through soong_config_set OPLUS_LINEAGE_TOUCH_HAL INCLUDE_DIR in
// device.mk. The legacy HIDL vendor.lineage.touch@1.0 interface was removed
// upstream in lineage-23, so the old service.cpp / TouchscreenGesture.* here
// are retained for reference only and are intentionally not built.
